# 🐞 BugHunt-Demo - A Beginner Friendly Bug Hunting Project

Welcome to **BugHunt-Demo**, a sample project created for learning and demonstrating the basics of bug hunting, input validation issues, and test case writing. This project is designed especially for **beginners** who are curious about software testing, bug reporting, and automation.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Simulated vulnerable Python app
- Includes test cases for bug detection
- Sample bug report included
- Beginner-friendly and documented

---

## 🔧 Tools Used

- Python 3.x
- pytest
- Git & GitHub
- OWASP ZAP (optional)
- Postman (optional)

---

